      "text": "{\n  \"certificate\": {\n    \"number\": \"R51/2006-GB1-09.04\",\n    \"project_number\": \"T1108/0053\",\n    \"page_total\": 7,\n    \"member_state\": \"United Kingdom\",\n    \"date_issued\": \"2014-07-28\"\n  },\n  \"issuing_authority\": {\n    \"name\": \"National Measurement Office\",\n    \"address_lines\": [\"Stanton Avenue\", \"Teddington\", \"TW11 0JZ\", \"United Kingdom\"],\n    \"person_responsible\": \"Paul Dixon\",\n    \"person_title\": \"Product Certification Manager\",\n    \"phone\": \"+44 (0)20 8943 7272\",\n    \"website\": \"www.gov.uk/nmo\"\n  },\n  \"applicants\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Thermo Ramsey Italia S.R.L.\",\n      \"address_lines\": [\"Strada Rivoltana km 6/7\", \"Rodano (MI)\", \"20090\", \"Italy\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"manufacturers\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Thermo Ramsey Italia S.R.L.\",\n      \"address_lines\": [\"Strada Rivoltana km 6/7\", \"Rodano (MI)\", \"20090\", \"Italy\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"certified_type\": {\n    \"category\": \"Checkweigher\",\n    \"type_designations\": [\"VersaWeigh\", \"VersaGP\", \"Versa RxC\", \"Versa RxM\", \"Versa Chain\", \"Teorema\"],\n    \"module_designation\": \"Not applicable\",\n    \"description\": \"Mains-powered automatic checkweighing instrument (Category X). Constructions: VersaWeigh and VersaGP with the standard weighing system (VersaGP with integrated frame and adjustable-height supports); VersaWeigh and VersaGP alternatively with the Slack Conveyor non-powered weighing system; Versa RxC in stainless steel construction with the standard weighing system; Versa RxM and Versa Chain in stainless steel construction with the Slack Conveyor weighing system; Teorema with floor-standing frame conveyor and remote electrical cabinet with HMI. Devices: initial zero-setting, zero-tracking, automatic alarm device active during automatic operation (zero setting requested at least every 11 min), pre-set tare (subtractive), multi-range operation, static calibration not accessible to the user, dynamic calibration accessible to the user and recorded, internal memory for batch reports, device that acts upon significant faults, screen check at power-up. Interfaces: RS 232, USB, Ethernet, Parallel. Software: general software V312 Version 37.00.01.xx, legally relevant module 'MID Module' (shown in Menu/Tools/Versions); alternative software V312 Version 2.0 (37.00.02.xx) with selectable options for multi-lane, intermittent checkweigher (static-weigh; restricted to Slack Conveyor systems and Max <= 1500 g), data matrix, OEM and Teorema applications, and dedicated versions for Tare/Gross (39.00.01.xx), Multiproduct (41.00.01.xx) and Twin (42.00.01.xx) applications. Other load cell Emax values may be chosen provided sensitivity > 1 uV/e (Teorema: > 0.33 uV/div). Remote cabinets permitted for VersaWeigh and VersaGP provided the load cell is connected to the cabinet via metal conduit.\"\n  },\n  \"model_family\": {\n    \"family_name\": null,\n    \"models\": [\n      {\"model_id\": \"VersaWeigh Max=1200g\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"VersaWeigh Max=2400g\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"VersaWeigh Max=4800g\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"VersaWeigh Max=12000g\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"VersaWeigh Max=24000g\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"VersaWeigh Max=48000g\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.1g\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.2g\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.5g\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"SlackConveyor Max=600g\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"SlackConveyor Max=1500g\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"SlackConveyor Max=3000g\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"SlackConveyor Max=6000g\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"SlackConveyor Max=15000g\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"Teorema Max=800g\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"Teorema Max=1600g\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"Teorema Max=3200g\"}\n    ]\n  },\n  \"components\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"load_cell (standard weighing system: VersaWeigh, VersaGP, Versa RxC)\",\n      \"type_designations\": [\"Tedea Huntleigh 1042 C3\", \"Tedea Huntleigh 1250 C3\"],\n      \"alternatives\": \"OR\",\n      \"characteristics\": {\n        \"tested_capacity\": {\"value\": 10, \"unit_symbol\": \"kg\"},\n        \"capacity_by_variant\": \"10 kg / 20 kg / 30 kg / 100 kg / 100 or 200 kg / 100 or 300 kg\",\n        \"replacement_conditions\": \"Any compatible load cell with a valid OIML R60 Certificate of Conformity containing the necessary load cell data; not a load cell with digital output; nlc, Y, Z same or better than Tedea 1042 C3 10 kg; same design and material; no oil damper; load cell marked NH allowed only if humidity tested to R76\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"load_cell (Slack Conveyor weighing system: VersaWeigh, VersaGP, Versa RxM, Versa Chain)\",\n      \"type_designations\": [\"Vishay Celtron LPS\"],\n      \"alternatives\": null,\n      \"characteristics\": {\n        \"tested_capacity\": {\"value\": 2, \"unit_symbol\": \"kg\"},\n        \"replacement_conditions\": \"Any compatible load cell with a valid OIML R60 Certificate of Conformity containing the necessary load cell data; not a load cell with digital output; nlc, Y, Z same or better than Vishay Celtron LPS 2 kg; same design and material; no oil damper; load cell marked NH allowed only if humidity tested to R76\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"load_cell (Teorema)\",\n      \"type_designations\": [\"Tedea Huntleigh 1130 C3\"],\n      \"alternatives\": null,\n      \"characteristics\": {\n        \"tested_capacity\": {\"value\": 30, \"unit_symbol\": \"kg\"},\n        \"replacement_conditions\": \"Any compatible load cell with a valid OIML R60 Certificate of Conformity containing the necessary load cell data; not a load cell with digital output; nlc, Y, Z same or better than Tedea Huntleigh 1130 C3 30 kg; same design and material; no oil damper; load cell marked NH allowed only if humidity tested to R76\"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"characteristics\": {\n    \"type_level\": {\n      \"accuracy_class\": {\"value\": \"XIII(1)\", \"unit_symbol\": null, \"unit_id\": null, \"footnote_markers\": []},\n      \"power_supply_type\": {\"value\": \"AC\", \"unit_symbol\": null, \"unit_id\": null, \"footnote_markers\": []},\n      \"climatic_environment\": {\"value\": \"Non-condensing (closed)\", \"unit_symbol\": null, \"unit_id\": null, \"footnote_markers\": []},\n      \"interfaces\": {\"value\": \"RS 232, USB, Ethernet, Parallel\", \"unit_symbol\": null, \"unit_id\": null, \"footnote_markers\": []}\n    },\n    \"model_level\": [\n      {\n        \"attribute\": \"maximum_capacity\",\n        \"unit_symbol\": \"g\",\n        \"values\": [\n          {\"model\": \"VersaWeigh Max=1200g\", \"value\": 1200},\n          {\"model\": \"VersaWeigh Max=2400g\", \"value\": 2400},\n          {\"model\": \"VersaWeigh Max=4800g\", \"value\": 4800},\n          {\"model\": \"VersaWeigh Max=12000g\", \"value\": 12000},\n          {\"model\": \"VersaWeigh Max=24000g\", \"value\": 24000},\n          {\"model\": \"VersaWeigh Max=48000g\", \"value\": 48000},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.1g\", \"value\": 300},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.2g\", \"value\": 300},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.5g\", \"value\": 300},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=600g\", \"value\": 600},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=1500g\", \"value\": 1500},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=3000g\", \"value\": 3000},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=6000g\", \"value\": 6000},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=15000g\", \"value\": 15000},\n          {\"model\": \"Teorema Max=800g\", \"value\": 800},\n          {\"model\": \"Teorema Max=1600g\", \"value\": 1600},\n          {\"model\": \"Teorema Max=3200g\", \"value\": 3200}\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"attribute\": \"minimum_capacity\",\n        \"unit_symbol\": \"g\",\n        \"values\": [\n          {\"model\": \"VersaWeigh Max=1200g\", \"value\": 35},\n          {\"model\": \"VersaWeigh Max=2400g\", \"value\": 70},\n          {\"model\": \"VersaWeigh Max=4800g\", \"value\": 140},\n          {\"model\": \"VersaWeigh Max=12000g\", \"value\": 350},\n          {\"model\": \"VersaWeigh Max=24000g\", \"value\": 700},\n          {\"model\": \"VersaWeigh Max=48000g\", \"value\": 1400},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.1g\", \"value\": 4.5},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.2g\", \"value\": 10},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.5g\", \"value\": 10},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=600g\", \"value\": 20},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=1500g\", \"value\": 50},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=3000g\", \"value\": 100},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=6000g\", \"value\": 200},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=15000g\", \"value\": 500},\n          {\"model\": \"Teorema Max=800g\", \"value\": 42},\n          {\"model\": \"Teorema Max=1600g\", \"value\": 84},\n          {\"model\": \"Teorema Max=3200g\", \"value\": 168}\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"attribute\": \"scale_interval_e\",\n        \"unit_symbol\": \"g\",\n        \"values\": [\n          {\"model\": \"VersaWeigh Max=1200g\", \"value\": {\"min\": 0.5, \"max\": null}},\n          {\"model\": \"VersaWeigh Max=2400g\", \"value\": {\"min\": 1, \"max\": null}},\n          {\"model\": \"VersaWeigh Max=4800g\", \"value\": {\"min\": 2, \"max\": null}},\n          {\"model\": \"VersaWeigh Max=12000g\", \"value\": {\"min\": 5, \"max\": null}},\n          {\"model\": \"VersaWeigh Max=24000g\", \"value\": {\"min\": 10, \"max\": null}},\n          {\"model\": \"VersaWeigh Max=48000g\", \"value\": {\"min\": 20, \"max\": null}},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.1g\", \"value\": {\"min\": 0.1, \"max\": null}},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.2g\", \"value\": {\"min\": 0.2, \"max\": null}},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.5g\", \"value\": {\"min\": 0.5, \"max\": null}},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=600g\", \"value\": {\"min\": 0.2, \"max\": null}},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=1500g\", \"value\": {\"min\": 0.5, \"max\": null}},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=3000g\", \"value\": {\"min\": 1, \"max\": null}},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=6000g\", \"value\": {\"min\": 2, \"max\": null}},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=15000g\", \"value\": {\"min\": 5, \"max\": null}},\n          {\"model\": \"Teorema Max=800g\", \"value\": \">=0.5 g (42-125 g); >=1 g (125-250 g); >=2 g (250-800 g)\"},\n          {\"model\": \"Teorema Max=1600g\", \"value\": \">=1 g (84-250 g); >=2 g (250-500 g); >=5 g (500-1600 g)\"},\n          {\"model\": \"Teorema Max=3200g\", \"value\": \">=2 g (168-500 g); >=5 g (500-1000 g); >=10 g (1000-3200 g)\"}\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"attribute\": \"load_cell_emax\",\n        \"unit_symbol\": \"kg\",\n        \"values\": [\n          {\"model\": \"VersaWeigh Max=1200g\", \"value\": 10},\n          {\"model\": \"VersaWeigh Max=2400g\", \"value\": 20},\n          {\"model\": \"VersaWeigh Max=4800g\", \"value\": 30},\n          {\"model\": \"VersaWeigh Max=12000g\", \"value\": 100},\n          {\"model\": \"VersaWeigh Max=24000g\", \"value\": \"100 or 200\"},\n          {\"model\": \"VersaWeigh Max=48000g\", \"value\": \"100 or 300\"},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.1g\", \"value\": 2},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.2g\", \"value\": \"2 or 3\"},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.5g\", \"value\": {\"min\": 2, \"max\": 10}},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=600g\", \"value\": 3},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=1500g\", \"value\": 10},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=3000g\", \"value\": 20},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=6000g\", \"value\": 35},\n          {\"model\": \"SlackConveyor Max=15000g\", \"value\": 100},\n          {\"model\": \"Teorema Max=800g\", \"value\": 30},\n          {\"model\": \"Teorema Max=1600g\", \"value\": 50},\n          {\"model\": \"Teorema Max=3200g\", \"value\": 100}\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"config_level\": [\n      {\n        \"attribute\": \"maximum_number_of_scale_intervals\",\n        \"axis\": \"weighing_system\",\n        \"values\": [\n          {\"condition\": \"standard weighing system (VersaWeigh, VersaGP, Versa RxC)\", \"value\": 2400},\n          {\"condition\": \"Slack Conveyor weighing system (VersaWeigh, VersaGP, Versa RxM, Versa Chain)\", \"value\": 3000},\n          {\"condition\": \"Teorema\", \"value\": 1600}\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"attribute\": \"power_supply_voltage\",\n        \"axis\": \"weighing_system\",\n        \"values\": [\n          {\"condition\": \"standard weighing system (VersaWeigh, VersaGP, Versa RxC)\", \"value\": {\"min\": 115, \"max\": 250}, \"unit_symbol\": \"V\"},\n          {\"condition\": \"Slack Conveyor weighing system (VersaWeigh, VersaGP, Versa RxM, Versa Chain)\", \"value\": {\"min\": 115, \"max\": 230}, \"unit_symbol\": \"V\"},\n          {\"condition\": \"Teorema\", \"value\": 230, \"unit_symbol\": \"V\"}\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"attribute\": \"power_supply_frequency\",\n        \"axis\": \"weighing_system\",\n        \"values\": [\n          {\"condition\": \"standard weighing system (VersaWeigh, VersaGP, Versa RxC)\", \"value\": 50, \"unit_symbol\": \"Hz\"},\n          {\"condition\": \"Slack Conveyor weighing system (VersaWeigh, VersaGP, Versa RxM, Versa Chain)\", \"value\": {\"min\": 50, \"max\": 60}, \"unit_symbol\": \"Hz\"},\n          {\"condition\": \"Teorema\", \"value\": {\"min\": 50, \"max\": 60}, \"unit_symbol\": \"Hz\"}\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"attribute\": \"temperature_range\",\n        \"axis\": \"weighing_system\",\n        \"values\": [\n          {\"condition\": \"standard weighing system (VersaWeigh, VersaGP, Versa RxC)\", \"value\": {\"min\": 0, \"max\": 40}, \"unit_symbol\": \"°C\"},\n          {\"condition\": \"Slack Conveyor weighing system (VersaWeigh, VersaGP, Versa RxM, Versa Chain)\", \"value\": {\"min\": 0, \"max\": 40}, \"unit_symbol\": \"°C\"},\n          {\"condition\": \"Teorema\", \"value\": {\"min\": 5, \"max\": 40}, \"unit_symbol\": \"°C\"}\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"attribute\": \"electromagnetic_environment\",\n        \"axis\": \"weighing_system\",\n        \"values\": [\n          {\"condition\": \"Slack Conveyor weighing system (VersaWeigh, VersaGP, Versa RxM, Versa Chain)\", \"value\": \"E1 and E2\"},\n          {\"condition\": \"Teorema\", \"value\": \"E1 and E2\"}\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"attribute\": \"tare\",\n        \"axis\": \"weighing_system\",\n        \"values\": [\n          {\"condition\": \"standard weighing system (VersaWeigh, VersaGP, Versa RxC)\", \"value\": \"-500 e (single-range instruments); -500 e1 (multi-range instruments)\"},\n          {\"condition\": \"Slack Conveyor weighing system (VersaWeigh, VersaGP, Versa RxM, Versa Chain)\", \"value\": \"T <= 30% Gross for Gross <= 500e; T <= 50% Gross for 500e < Gross <= 3000e for speed <= 1.8 m/s; T <= 15% Gross for 500e < Gross <= 2000e for speed >= 1.8 m/s; T <= 50% Gross for 2000e < Gross <= 3000e (e1 replaces e for multi-range instruments)\"},\n          {\"condition\": \"Teorema\", \"value\": \"T <= 30% Gross\"}\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"attribute\": \"maximum_conveyor_speed\",\n        \"axis\": \"weighing_system\",\n        \"values\": [\n          {\"condition\": \"standard weighing system (VersaWeigh, VersaGP, Versa RxC)\", \"value\": 1.2, \"unit_symbol\": \"m/s\"}\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"attribute\": \"maximum_conveyor_speed\",\n        \"axis\": \"number_of_scale_intervals (Slack Conveyor weighing system)\",\n        \"values\": [\n          {\"condition\": \"Min - 100\", \"value\": 1.6, \"unit_symbol\": \"m/s\"},\n          {\"condition\": \"100 - 2000\", \"value\": 2.0, \"unit_symbol\": \"m/s\"},\n          {\"condition\": \"2000 - 3000\", \"value\": 1.6, \"unit_symbol\": \"m/s\"}\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"attribute\": \"maximum_conveyor_speed\",\n        \"axis\": \"weighing_range (Teorema)\",\n        \"values\": [\n          {\"condition\": \"W1\", \"value\": 1.6, \"unit_symbol\": \"m/s\"},\n          {\"condition\": \"W2\", \"value\": 2.6, \"unit_symbol\": \"m/s\"},\n          {\"condition\": \"W3\", \"value\": 2.6, \"unit_symbol\": \"m/s\"}\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"attribute\": \"minimum_required_sensitivity_for_alternative_load_cell_emax\",\n        \"axis\": \"weighing_system\",\n        \"values\": [\n          {\"condition\": \"standard and Slack Conveyor weighing systems\", \"value\": {\"min\": 1, \"max\": null}, \"unit_symbol\": \"µV/e\"},\n          {\"condition\": \"Teorema\", \"value\": {\"min\": 0.33, \"max\": null}, \"unit_symbol\": \"µV/div\"}\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"attribute\": \"automatic_zero_setting_frequency\",\n        \"axis\": \"weighing_system\",\n        \"values\": [\n          {\"condition\": \"Teorema\", \"value\": \"7 min 25 s\"}\n        ]\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"matrix_tables\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Technical data - VersaWeigh standard weighing system\",\n      \"columns\": [\"attribute\", \"VersaWeigh Max=1200g\", \"VersaWeigh Max=2400g\", \"VersaWeigh Max=4800g\", \"VersaWeigh Max=12000g\", \"VersaWeigh Max=24000g\", \"VersaWeigh Max=48000g\"],\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\"attribute\": \"maximum_capacity_g\", \"VersaWeigh Max=1200g\": 1200, \"VersaWeigh Max=2400g\": 2400, \"VersaWeigh Max=4800g\": 4800, \"VersaWeigh Max=12000g\": 12000, \"VersaWeigh Max=24000g\": 24000, \"VersaWeigh Max=48000g\": 48000},\n        {\"attribute\": \"minimum_capacity_g\", \"VersaWeigh Max=1200g\": 35, \"VersaWeigh Max=2400g\": 70, \"VersaWeigh Max=4800g\": 140, \"VersaWeigh Max=12000g\": 350, \"VersaWeigh Max=24000g\": 700, \"VersaWeigh Max=48000g\": 1400},\n        {\"attribute\": \"scale_interval_e_min_g\", \"VersaWeigh Max=1200g\": 0.5, \"VersaWeigh Max=2400g\": 1, \"VersaWeigh Max=4800g\": 2, \"VersaWeigh Max=12000g\": 5, \"VersaWeigh Max=24000g\": 10, \"VersaWeigh Max=48000g\": 20},\n        {\"attribute\": \"load_cell_emax_kg\", \"VersaWeigh Max=1200g\": 10, \"VersaWeigh Max=2400g\": 20, \"VersaWeigh Max=4800g\": 30, \"VersaWeigh Max=12000g\": 100, \"VersaWeigh Max=24000g\": \"100 or 200\", \"VersaWeigh Max=48000g\": \"100 or 300\"}\n      ],\n      \"description\": \"Values per Max capacity variant; scale interval values are minimum permitted (e >= value). Further fixed data for this construction: maximum number of scale intervals n = 2400; tare = -500 e (single-range) / -500 e1 (multi-range); belt speed 1.2 m/s; climatic environment 0°C to +40°C non-condensing (closed); power supply 115-250 V a.c. 50 Hz; accuracy class XIII(1). Other load cell Emax values allowed if sensitivity > 1 µV/e.\",\n      \"footnotes\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Technical data - Slack Conveyor weighing system (Vishay Celtron LPS)\",\n      \"columns\": [\"attribute\", \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.1g\", \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.2g\", \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.5g\", \"SlackConveyor Max=600g\", \"SlackConveyor Max=1500g\", \"SlackConveyor Max=3000g\", \"SlackConveyor Max=6000g\", \"SlackConveyor Max=15000g\"],\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\"attribute\": \"maximum_capacity_g\", \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.1g\": 300, \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.2g\": 300, \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.5g\": 300, \"SlackConveyor Max=600g\": 600, \"SlackConveyor Max=1500g\": 1500, \"SlackConveyor Max=3000g\": 3000, \"SlackConveyor Max=6000g\": 6000, \"SlackConveyor Max=15000g\": 15000},\n        {\"attribute\": \"minimum_capacity_g\", \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.1g\": 4.5, \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.2g\": 10, \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.5g\": 10, \"SlackConveyor Max=600g\": 20, \"SlackConveyor Max=1500g\": 50, \"SlackConveyor Max=3000g\": 100, \"SlackConveyor Max=6000g\": 200, \"SlackConveyor Max=15000g\": 500},\n        {\"attribute\": \"scale_interval_e_min_g\", \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.1g\": 0.1, \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.2g\": 0.2, \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.5g\": 0.5, \"SlackConveyor Max=600g\": 0.2, \"SlackConveyor Max=1500g\": 0.5, \"SlackConveyor Max=3000g\": 1, \"SlackConveyor Max=6000g\": 2, \"SlackConveyor Max=15000g\": 5},\n        {\"attribute\": \"load_cell_emax_kg\", \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.1g\": 2, \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.2g\": \"2 or 3\", \"SlackConveyor Max=300g e>=0.5g\": \"2-10\", \"SlackConveyor Max=600g\": 3, \"SlackConveyor Max=1500g\": 10, \"SlackConveyor Max=3000g\": 20, \"SlackConveyor Max=6000g\": 35, \"SlackConveyor Max=15000g\": 100}\n      ],\n      \"description\": \"Values per Max capacity variant; scale interval values are minimum permitted (e >= value). Further fixed data: maximum number of scale intervals n = 3000; climatic environment 0°C to +40°C non-condensing (closed); electromagnetic environments E1 and E2; power supply 115-230 V a.c. 50/60 Hz; accuracy class XIII(1).\",\n      \"footnotes\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Technical data - Teorema (Tedea Huntleigh 1130 C3)\",\n      \"columns\": [\"attribute\", \"Teorema Max=800g\", \"Teorema Max=1600g\", \"Teorema Max=3200g\"],\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\"attribute\": \"maximum_capacity_g\", \"Teorema Max=800g\": 800, \"Teorema Max=1600g\": 1600, \"Teorema Max=3200g\": 3200},\n        {\"attribute\": \"minimum_capacity_g\", \"Teorema Max=800g\": 42, \"Teorema Max=1600g\": 84, \"Teorema Max=3200g\": 168},\n        {\"attribute\": \"scale_interval_g\", \"Teorema Max=800g\": \">=0.5 (42-125 g); >=1 (125-250 g); >=2 (250-800 g)\", \"Teorema Max=1600g\": \">=1 (84-250 g); >=2 (250-500 g); >=5 (500-1600 g)\", \"Teorema Max=3200g\": \">=2 (168-500 g); >=5 (500-1000 g); >=10 (1000-3200 g)\"},\n        {\"attribute\": \"load_cell_emax_kg\", \"Teorema Max=800g\": 30, \"Teorema Max=1600g\": 50, \"Teorema Max=3200g\": 100}\n      ],\n      \"description\": \"Multi-range scale intervals per weighing range. Further fixed data: maximum number of scale intervals n = 1600; tare T <= 30% Gross; climatic environment 5°C to +40°C non-condensing (closed); electromagnetic environments E1 and E2; power supply 230 V a.c. 50/60 Hz; accuracy class XIII(1). Other load cell Emax values allowed if sensitivity > 0.33 µV/div.\",\n      \"footnotes\": []\n   "
    }
  ],
